WEBVTT

00:00:07.714 --> 00:00:09.466
(neighs)

00:00:10.216 --> 00:00:11.259
(chattering)

00:00:11.342 --> 00:00:13.344
(yelling)

00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:16.681
(soft yelling in distance)

00:00:18.516 --> 00:00:20.226
(laughs)

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.811
(all laughing)

00:00:24.564 --> 00:00:25.648
(bones cracking)

00:00:25.732 --> 00:00:26.858
(inhales)

00:00:26.941 --> 00:00:28.902
(deep, loud bellowing)

00:00:28.985 --> 00:00:30.695
(chuckles) Hmm?

00:00:33.531 --> 00:00:34.783
(groans)

00:00:34.866 --> 00:00:36.409
Grab your weapons, mates.
拿起武器 弟兄们

00:00:36.493 --> 00:00:37.660
ALL: Arr!
拿起武器 弟兄们

00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:38.787
(laughing)

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:39.788
Yeah!

00:00:39.871 --> 00:00:43.166
-(yells) Oh.
-GUTT: Not the spoon, Flynn.
别拿勺子啊 福林

00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:45.001
-(chuckles)
-Follow me!
跟我上

00:00:45.084 --> 00:00:46.085
-(all yelling)
-Yeah, let's do this.
好的 我们走

00:00:46.169 --> 00:00:48.129
(yelling and laughing)
好的 我们走

00:00:48.213 --> 00:00:49.631
SQUINT: Let me at him.
我来搞定它 耶

00:00:49.714 --> 00:00:51.090
Yeah, it's game time now.
我来搞定它 耶

00:00:51.174 --> 00:00:53.635
-(panting)
-SQUINT: Let's go!

00:00:56.638 --> 00:00:57.931
Guys, that's not necessary.
伙计们 不用这么热情 真的

00:00:58.014 --> 00:00:59.390
Really.
伙计们 不用这么热情 真的

00:00:59.474 --> 00:01:01.392
I... I love you, too. Yeah.
嗯嗯 我也爱你们

00:01:01.476 --> 00:01:02.936
SID: Get to the ship.
Don't screw up.
偷偷靠近船 不要搞砸了

00:01:03.019 --> 00:01:04.854
Get to the ship.
Don't screw up.
偷偷靠近船 不要搞砸了

00:01:04.938 --> 00:01:05.939
Unwind the vines.
解开绳索

00:01:06.022 --> 00:01:07.023
Don't let go.
不要松手

00:01:07.106 --> 00:01:08.316
Unwind the vines.
解开绳索

00:01:08.399 --> 00:01:10.276
-Don't let go.
-Unwind the vines.
不要松手

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.111
Don't let... Oh, yum-o!
不要松 哦 好吃的

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.030
(chuckling)

00:01:14.113 --> 00:01:15.865
-Oh, mmm.
-DIEGO: Sid, no.
希德 别

00:01:16.241 --> 00:01:17.659
It's a lotus berry.
那个是莲花果

00:01:17.742 --> 00:01:19.035
It'll paralyze you.
吃了会浑身麻痹的

00:01:19.118 --> 00:01:21.287
Oh, please.
I know my berries.
哦 拜托 果子什么我懂的

00:01:22.121 --> 00:01:23.081
-DIEGO: Don't...
-(swallows)
不要

00:01:23.164 --> 00:01:24.165
...swallow.
咽下去

00:01:24.249 --> 00:01:25.291
See, I'm fine.
瞧 我没事

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:28.294
If there's one thing I know,
it's berries.
如果要说我的专长 那就是果子

00:01:28.837 --> 00:01:30.421
Huh? (groans)
如果要说我的专长 那就是果子

00:01:30.505 --> 00:01:31.714
Uh-oh.

00:01:31.798 --> 00:01:33.842
(all hooting, whooping)

00:01:33.925 --> 00:01:36.094
(panting)

00:01:37.804 --> 00:01:38.638
(high-pitched chattering)

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:47.021
(panting, grunting)

00:01:50.733 --> 00:01:53.695
(laughing, whooping)

00:01:55.154 --> 00:01:55.989
(grunting)

00:02:01.744 --> 00:02:03.496
Yeah! Finally!
耶 终于又见了

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:04.414
(yells)

00:02:05.415 --> 00:02:06.958
Who's the Easter Bunny now?
你说谁是复活节兔子

00:02:07.709 --> 00:02:08.626
(laughing)

00:02:12.881 --> 00:02:13.840
(growls)

00:02:14.424 --> 00:02:16.009
It worked. He bought it.
成功了 他上当了

00:02:16.092 --> 00:02:17.552
-Come on.
-GUTT: No, no, no!
不 不 我们被他们玩了

00:02:17.886 --> 00:02:19.095
It's been a diversion.
不 不 我们被他们玩了

00:02:19.178 --> 00:02:20.013
I know.
我知道

00:02:20.096 --> 00:02:21.306
I'm having a blast.
我玩得挺开心

00:02:21.389 --> 00:02:22.807
-No, pinhead.
-Ow!
不 猪脑袋 他们要偷我的船

00:02:22.891 --> 00:02:24.893
They're stealing my ship. They're stealing my ship.
不 猪脑袋 他们要偷我的船

00:02:28.897 --> 00:02:30.148
One thing, Sid.
一件事 希德 就一件事都你做不好

00:02:30.231 --> 00:02:31.774
You couldn't do one thing?
一件事 希德 就一件事都你做不好

00:02:32.108 --> 00:02:33.192
Look at you.
瞧瞧你

00:02:34.068 --> 00:02:35.069
MANNY: Sid, can you hear me?
希德 你听得到吗

00:02:35.153 --> 00:02:36.070
Bye-bye.
再见

00:02:36.154 --> 00:02:37.322
Say something, buddy.
说句话啊 伙计

00:02:38.114 --> 00:02:38.948
Whoa.

00:02:39.032 --> 00:02:40.533
Let's get 'em!
干掉他们

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:41.993
Let's go.
我们走

00:02:42.076 --> 00:02:44.287
GRANNY: Whoop.
(Sid groans weakly)

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.788
MANNY:
The ship!
船走了

00:02:45.872 --> 00:02:48.583
Come on. We got to catch it
before it hits open water.
快点 我们要在它入海之前赶上它

00:02:52.045 --> 00:02:52.879
(babbling)

00:02:52.962 --> 00:02:54.213
-(groans)
-Sorry.
抱歉 我把你举高点

00:02:54.297 --> 00:02:55.632
All right,
I'll hold you higher.
抱歉 我把你举高点

00:02:55.715 --> 00:02:57.008
-(groaning)
-Sorry. Sorry.
抱歉 抱歉

00:02:57.091 --> 00:02:58.801
(laughing and yelling)

00:02:58.885 --> 00:03:00.345
Say adieu, mammoth!
说再见吧 猛犸象

00:03:00.428 --> 00:03:01.596
Ow!
说再见吧 猛犸象

00:03:01.679 --> 00:03:02.847
Adieu...!
再见

00:03:02.931 --> 00:03:03.765
Sorry, buddy.
抱歉 伙计

00:03:03.848 --> 00:03:05.683
(babbling)

00:03:06.059 --> 00:03:07.185
(grunts)

00:03:07.268 --> 00:03:08.895
(screams, grunts)

00:03:09.395 --> 00:03:10.730
-Huh?
-(screams)

00:03:11.064 --> 00:03:12.357
(dazed babbling)

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:14.275
(sighs)
I'm coming, Sid.
我这就来 希德

00:03:14.359 --> 00:03:15.860
(groaning)

00:03:16.235 --> 00:03:17.070
(grunting with effort)

00:03:19.405 --> 00:03:20.323
(babbling)

00:03:20.823 --> 00:03:21.824
(whimpers)

00:03:21.908 --> 00:03:23.242
MANNY: I got you. I got you.
接住了 接住了

00:03:23.326 --> 00:03:24.202
(grunting):
I got you.
接住了 接住了

00:03:24.285 --> 00:03:25.244
(growls)

00:03:25.578 --> 00:03:26.412
(whistles)

00:03:29.123 --> 00:03:30.333
(yells)

00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:32.877
I'm coming for you, mammoth.
我来追你了 猛犸象

00:03:34.462 --> 00:03:35.922
(laughs)

00:03:36.005 --> 00:03:37.757
(grunts) Whoa!

00:03:38.424 --> 00:03:39.717
(Diego grunts)

00:03:41.094 --> 00:03:42.553
Whee!

00:03:42.637 --> 00:03:44.722
(yells, grunts)

00:03:45.306 --> 00:03:46.224
(grunts)

00:03:46.683 --> 00:03:48.017
MANNY: Diego!
迭戈

00:03:48.643 --> 00:03:49.602
Come on!
快来啊

00:03:52.021 --> 00:03:52.981
(panting)

00:03:53.398 --> 00:03:54.565
Come on. Move it.
加油 跑快点

00:03:54.649 --> 00:03:55.733
(grunts)

00:03:55.817 --> 00:03:57.276
(panting)

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:58.611
(gasps)

00:04:01.406 --> 00:04:03.074
(strained grunting)

00:04:06.285 --> 00:04:07.328
Why are you doing this?
你为什么这么做

00:04:07.412 --> 00:04:08.830
You don't understand.
你不会明白的

00:04:08.913 --> 00:04:10.123
I don't have a choice.
我已经别无选择了

00:04:10.206 --> 00:04:11.791
You don't have to
live this way, Shira.
你不用过这样的生活 希拉

00:04:11.874 --> 00:04:13.334
You'll be safe with us.
跟我们走就没事了

00:04:13.418 --> 00:04:14.502
We take care
of each other.
我们可以互相照应

00:04:14.585 --> 00:04:15.628
MANNY:
Diego!
迭戈 我快要坚持不住了

00:04:15.712 --> 00:04:17.755
I can't hold on much longer.
迭戈 我快要坚持不住了

00:04:18.715 --> 00:04:20.466
-(grunts)
-MANNY: Diego?
迭戈

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:23.136
Come with us.
Come with me.
跟我们走

00:04:29.058 --> 00:04:30.810
(Gutt and crew yelling)

00:04:34.313 --> 00:04:35.273
(grunts)

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:36.899
What are you doing?
你这是干什么

00:04:36.983 --> 00:04:38.192
I've got your back.
我来照应你们

00:04:38.776 --> 00:04:39.861
(grunts)

00:04:40.236 --> 00:04:42.196
(yells)

00:04:46.034 --> 00:04:47.035
(grunts)

00:04:48.536 --> 00:04:49.871
(pants, gasps)

00:04:51.998 --> 00:04:53.416
(whooping)

00:04:59.088 --> 00:05:00.798
(spluttering)

00:05:00.882 --> 00:05:01.799
(growls)

00:05:03.301 --> 00:05:05.011
So long, banana breath.
别了 香蕉小子 谢谢你的船

00:05:05.094 --> 00:05:06.179
Thanks for the ship.
别了 香蕉小子 谢谢你的船

00:05:07.889 --> 00:05:09.807
(panting, growling)

00:05:14.145 --> 00:05:16.022
(grumbles)

00:05:17.523 --> 00:05:19.442
(grunting)

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:26.699
(grunting loudly)

00:05:30.703 --> 00:05:31.662
FLYNN: Oh, no.
哦不 这回他死定了

00:05:31.746 --> 00:05:32.830
He's gone forever.
哦不 这回他死定了

00:05:34.207 --> 00:05:35.792
Oh, there he is.
哦 他又来了

00:05:44.717 --> 00:05:46.469
Shore leave's over.
陆上休假结束了

00:05:46.552 --> 00:05:50.056
Get your sorry carcasses
on board now.
你们马上给我死到船上来

00:05:50.139 --> 00:05:51.432
(whimpering and groaning)

00:05:53.142 --> 00:05:53.976
(whistles)

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.978
(chittering)

00:06:01.317 --> 00:06:03.152
Gutt, I can explain.
肚肚 请听我解释

00:06:03.236 --> 00:06:04.654
-(gasps)
-When this ends,
等这事搞定

00:06:04.737 --> 00:06:08.199
I'll have a tiger's skin
hanging on my wall.
我要在我的墙上挂一张老虎皮

00:06:08.282 --> 00:06:09.158
(groans)

00:06:09.242 --> 00:06:11.536
I don't care whose.
我才不管是谁的皮

00:06:11.911 --> 00:06:13.621
-(groans)
-(Squint laughing)

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:15.414
GUTT: That mammoth
那头猛犸象抢走了我的船

00:06:15.498 --> 00:06:18.251
has taken my ship,
my bounty
那头猛犸象抢走了我的船

00:06:18.751 --> 00:06:21.712
and now the loyalty
of my crew.
还有船员对我的忠诚

00:06:21.796 --> 00:06:27.510
I will destroy him
and everything he loves.
我一定要毁了他

